        acquisition = "Difficulty: Hard - Find all eight correct Dalaran books among decoy spawns and multi-hour respawn timers.\n\n1. Travel to Dalaran above Crystalsong Forest and track Higher Learning (1956). Use one character for the eight books and Vargoth reward. Visit every missing location below; a book may be absent or replaced by a non-achievement title, so this usually needs repeat circuits.\n\n2. Read The Schools of Arcane Magic - Introduction at the Violet Gate (56.7, 46.1). Look on the floor beside the northern/right-hand bookcase inside the portal room.\n\n3. Read Conjuration in the Violet Citadel (30.9, 46.3). Stay on the entrance level and check the bottom of the bookcase on your right as you enter.\n\n4. Read Divination upstairs in the Violet Citadel (26.5, 51.7). Take the stairs and look on the floor near the bookcases by the Caverns of Time portal area. The two Citadel books are on different levels.\n\n5. Read Enchantment at Threads of Fate (43.6, 47.1). Go upstairs in the cloth-armor shop and out onto its balcony; inspect the crate outside, rather than the shop floor.\n\n6. Read Transmutation downstairs in the Legerdemain Lounge (46.9, 39.8). Check the ground-floor western bookcase near the entrance/stove.\n\n7. Read Necromancy upstairs in the Legerdemain Lounge (46.9, 39.1). Enter the western bedroom and inspect the empty bookcase. This is a separate spawn from the downstairs Transmutation book.\n\n8. Read Abjuration inside the Dalaran Visitor Center (52.2, 55.5). Look on the floor to the right of the entrance, beside the small table and books.\n\n9. Read Illusion by the Violet Hold (64.5, 52.8). At the entrance area, check the crate against the wall beside Archmage Timear. You do not need to enter or clear the dungeon.\n\n10. After all eight criteria complete, retrieve The Schools of Arcane Magic - Mastery from the achievement mail and learn the toy if needed. Look in your Toy Box if the book is already learned. The achievement alone does not 